			"notes": "# 1.1.0\n\n- Added Lootr compatibility via mixin: attempts to replace the item Lootr places in its per-player Elytra frame\n\n# 1.1.1\n\n- Fixed Lootr compatibility: the 1.1.0 mixin never actually worked (Mixin renames injected handler methods, so the hook silently never fired). Replaced with an `EntityJoinLevelEvent` listener that reliably swaps the item in Lootr's per-player Elytra frame\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MinenMaster/ElytraSwap/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.1"
